  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Better Lives for Displacement Affected Persons in South Sudan.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will contribute to self-reliance of displacement affected persons in South Sudan. Norwegian Refugee Council (Flyktninghjelpen) in collaboration with local civil society will ensure equitable access to inclusive, gender sensitive education, as well as water, sanitation and hygiene (WASH) and protection services. The project will support livelihoods and food production activities for improved food security through promotion of climate smart agricultural approaches and other off-farm initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
